{"id":"556df02a0470824a","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-hopf.md","title":"Hopf Decomposition","display":"thm-hopf — Hopf Decomposition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hopf","aliases":["58-thm-hopf"],"display":"thm-hopf — Hopf Decomposition","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[58-df-hopf-parts.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hopf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hopf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hopf — Hopf Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"153281e750377196\" href=\"?note=153281e750377196\" title=\"58-df-hopf-parts.md\">58-df-hopf-parts.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad78f775172312be\" href=\"?note=ad78f775172312be\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal M,\\mu,T\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu,T\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\)</span>，即本书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-有限测度谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\\)</span> 及整数迭代使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"153281e750377196\" href=\"?note=153281e750377196\" title=\"./58-df-hopf-parts.md\">58-df-hopf-parts.md</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=_\\mu B\">\\(A=_\\mu B\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\">\\(\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hopf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\land\\operatorname{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\n\\to\n\\exists C,D\\in\\mathcal M\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX=_\\mu C\\cup D\n\\land C\\cap D=_\\mu\\varnothing\n\\land T^{-1}[C]=_\\mu C\n\\land T^{-1}[D]=_\\mu D\n\\land\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hopf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\land\\operatorname{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\n\\to\n\\exists C,D\\in\\mathcal M\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX=_\\mu C\\cup D\n\\land C\\cap D=_\\mu\\varnothing\n\\land T^{-1}[C]=_\\mu C\n\\land T^{-1}[D]=_\\mu D\n\\land\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分解以零测集为等价意义；耗散部分由可测游荡集的整数迭代覆盖。这里的存在断言与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"153281e750377196\" href=\"?note=153281e750377196\" title=\"./58-df-hopf-parts.md\">58-df-hopf-parts.md</a> 的两类部分定义分开，定义没有预设分解存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hopf-parts.md","status":"resolved","id":"153281e750377196","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hopf-parts.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ad78f775172312be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-hopf-parts.md","status":"resolved","id":"153281e750377196","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)$、$\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)$、$\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)$ 及整数迭代使用 [[./58-df-hopf-parts.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-hopf-parts.md","status":"resolved","id":"153281e750377196","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"分解以零测集为等价意义；耗散部分由可测游荡集的整数迭代覆盖。这里的存在断言与 [[./58-df-hopf-parts.md]] 的两类部分定义分开，定义没有预设分解存在。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal M,\\mu,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"A=_\\mu B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hopf}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\land\\operatorname{InvertibleNonsingular}_S(T,X,\\mathcal M,\\mu)\n\\to\n\\exists C,D\\in\\mathcal M\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX=_\\mu C\\cup D\n\\land C\\cap D=_\\mu\\varnothing\n\\land T^{-1}[C]=_\\mu C\n\\land T^{-1}[D]=_\\mu D\n\\land\\mathrm{Conservative}_S(C,T,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Dissipative}_S(D,T,\\mu)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1391,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-hopf.md|58-thm-hopf]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","bbbec05fde1d3b01","153281e750377196","ad78f775172312be"]}